I added `openMinutes` at the end of `src/tides.ts`. It clips each window to the `from`–`to` stretch and sums the lengths that remain, returning 0 when `to` is not after `from`. It only reads the list and windows, so nothing is changed in them, and window order doesn't matter.

I couldn't see the file, so I assumed `LockWindow` is already defined or imported there with numeric `opens` and `closes` fields, as your description implies.
